<title>USA: Uniflex Inc Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Uniflex Inc Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>HICKSVILLE, N.Y. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended  For the Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			10/31/96   10/31/95    10/31/96    10/31/95</p>
<p> Net sales	$9,339,000 $8,754,000 $26,536,000 $24,282,000</p>
<p> Cost of sales   5,650,000  5,435,000  16,400,000  15,538,000</p>
<p>Operating costs</p>
<p>  and expenses   2,427,000  2,215,000   7,285,000   6,466,000</p>
<p>Operating income</p>
<p>		     1,262,000  1,104,000   2,851,000   2,278,000</p>
<p>Interest and other</p>
<p>  expenses	    48,000     96,000     178,000     330,000</p>
<p>Income before provision for income taxes</p>
<p>		     1,214,000  1,008,000   2,673,000   1,948,000</p>
<p>Provision for income</p>
<p>  taxes		476,000    407,000   1,060,000     751,000</p>
<p> Net income	  738,000    601,000   1,613,000   1,197,000</p>
<p>Income per common</p>
<p>  share (a)		.16	  .14	   .36	   .29</p>
<p>Weighted average shares outstanding (a)</p>
<p>		     4,510,000  4,165,000   4,476,000   4,086,000</p>
<p>Note: (a) On October 15, 1996, the company effected a three-for-two stock-split recorded in the form of a stock dividend payable to shareholders of record at Sept.25, 1996.</p>
<p>All references in the accompanying financial highlights to the number of common shares and per share amounts have been restated to reflect the stock dividend.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
